---
config:
  layout: dagre
---
flowchart TB
    Accounting["Accounting"] -- Owns books for --> Ledger["Ledger"]
    Accounting -- Provides context to --> Bookkeeping["Bookkeeping"]
    Bookkeeping -- Records balanced entries in --> JournalEntry["Journal Entry"]
    Bookkeeping -- Adjusts balances for --> Ledger
    Bookkeeping -- Uses rates from --> Currency["Currency"]
    JournalEntry -- Posts lines against --> Ledger
    Ledger -- Rolls detailed activity from --> Subledger["Subledger"]
    Subledger -- Uses valuation data from --> Currency
    User["User"] -- Manages --> Accounting

     Bookkeeping:::domainBox
     JournalEntry:::domainBox
     Ledger:::domainBox
     Currency:::domainBox
     Subledger:::domainBox
     Accounting:::domainBox
     User:::domainBox
    classDef domainBox fill:#e4f0f5,stroke:#0066cc,stroke-width:2px
